{"4264000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Orion Blue", "steam_appid": 4264000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Orion Blue</u></strong> is a relaxing fishing adventure set on a beautiful alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play actively, or enjoy fishing at your own pace with idle progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a peaceful world and build your own life on Orion Blue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/17573455d7ea1aad5db076163d8b246a.poster.avif?t=1788323033\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/17573455d7ea1aad5db076163d8b246a.webm?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/17573455d7ea1aad5db076163d8b246a.mp4?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the beautiful planet Orion Blue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover diverse fish species and mysterious lifeforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fish to earn money, or process them into valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/48ffb7a9876550d66284bc48aef999a5.poster.avif?t=1788323033\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/48ffb7a9876550d66284bc48aef999a5.webm?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/48ffb7a9876550d66284bc48aef999a5.mp4?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy fishing across diverse regions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area offers its own unique atmosphere and discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish at your own pace in stunning environments and work toward completing your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/41f2bc3dda1c39fbe235e0278a7cb7f6.poster.avif?t=1788323033\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/41f2bc3dda1c39fbe235e0278a7cb7f6.webm?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/41f2bc3dda1c39fbe235e0278a7cb7f6.mp4?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/74b85bf2be7956113ca8184beaf79eda.poster.avif?t=1788323033\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/74b85bf2be7956113ca8184beaf79eda.webm?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/74b85bf2be7956113ca8184beaf79eda.mp4?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the residents of the planet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orion Blue is home to many residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of them are around your age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with them and slowly build meaningful relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/738a5107abf44d75bc351d0c9ddacc8e.poster.avif?t=1788323033\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/738a5107abf44d75bc351d0c9ddacc8e.webm?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/738a5107abf44d75bc351d0c9ddacc8e.mp4?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/c1a138fe512c2052ddd64c2e77c4e0a0.avif?t=1788323033\" width=900 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From friendship to romance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each resident has their own daily life, events, and personal stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow closer, they may open up to you—and some relationships may even turn into romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/0ee23725a088103b49aded44d57d7db0.poster.avif?t=1788323033\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/0ee23725a088103b49aded44d57d7db0.webm?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264000/extras/0ee23725a088103b49aded44d57d7db0.mp4?t=1788323033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><st